WEBVTT

01:30.880 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.039 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 38]

01:38.479 --> 01:39.800
There's one month left

01:40.229 --> 01:41.360
to the half-year bet

01:42.150 --> 01:43.830
you made with Mr. Gu.

01:44.150 --> 01:45.120
I said you will head over

01:45.120 --> 01:47.050
after the seventh day of mourning.

01:50.870 --> 01:52.000
Is Gu Pingyuan ready

01:52.000 --> 01:53.259
to give up what he owes?

01:57.280 --> 01:59.080
Why aren't you saying anything?

02:01.630 --> 02:02.490
Say something.

02:03.510 --> 02:04.310
Young Master.

02:05.310 --> 02:06.310
I have failed you.

02:13.190 --> 02:14.180
Impossible!

02:14.800 --> 02:16.200
Absolutely impossible!

02:17.750 --> 02:19.500
I invested so much money!

02:19.910 --> 02:21.390
Two hundred shops!

02:21.960 --> 02:23.829
I should have crushed him easily!

02:24.010 --> 02:25.280
Young Master, it was not quite 200—

02:25.280 --> 02:26.700
it was 188 shops.

02:27.030 --> 02:28.470
Counting wages and rent,

02:28.520 --> 02:29.710
we've been losing money.

02:29.710 --> 02:31.150
No one would open

02:31.170 --> 02:33.430
-two salt shops in each town.
-That's none of your business!

02:33.430 --> 02:34.940
I'll bear the losses.

02:42.440 --> 02:43.570
The losses are mine.

02:44.560 --> 02:45.560
But the profit

02:45.560 --> 02:47.290
must have exceeded his, right?

02:50.800 --> 02:52.600
Why aren't you saying anything?

02:53.530 --> 02:54.329
Young Master.

02:55.190 --> 02:56.920
Mr. Gu made an unexpected move.

02:57.260 --> 02:57.750
He opened

02:57.750 --> 02:59.240
231 shops.

02:59.710 --> 03:00.710
For Guangdong, Guangxi, Shanxi,
and Shaanxi,

03:00.710 --> 03:02.240
he used canal transport and horse caravans

03:02.240 --> 03:03.400
to transport salt
from Changlu's salt farms,

03:03.400 --> 03:04.240
well salt from Sichuan,

03:04.240 --> 03:05.240
and salt from Lianghuai

03:05.240 --> 03:06.450
to be sold there.

03:07.560 --> 03:09.020
The profits are enormous.

03:14.770 --> 03:15.770
He cannot win.

03:17.090 --> 03:17.910
He cannot win.

03:19.560 --> 03:20.560
This isn't right.

03:21.630 --> 03:22.630
This isn't right.

03:24.150 --> 03:26.150
He's openly defying

03:26.170 --> 03:28.630
the imperial court's salt administration.

03:29.190 --> 03:31.320
I'm going to the capital to report him.

03:31.800 --> 03:32.600
Young Master.

03:33.470 --> 03:34.710
Master has passed on.

03:34.740 --> 03:35.970
Who can we rely on?

03:38.290 --> 03:39.220
This time,

03:40.280 --> 03:41.440
we've truly lost.

03:44.440 --> 03:47.540
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

03:51.750 --> 03:53.210
You're really something.

03:54.400 --> 03:55.960
How did you manage this?

03:58.620 --> 03:59.800
We found a route

03:59.800 --> 04:00.630
from Sichuan that allows us

04:00.630 --> 04:02.000
to transport salt here.

04:02.310 --> 04:03.520
The Changlu salt region

04:03.520 --> 04:04.960
has been peaceful for many years.

04:04.960 --> 04:06.630
Their salt reserves are abundant

04:06.630 --> 04:07.690
and prices are low.

04:07.910 --> 04:09.300
As for the salt regions in Shandong,

04:09.300 --> 04:10.710
they can't sell outside the province,

04:10.710 --> 04:13.560
but the province itself
doesn't consume nearly enough.

04:13.560 --> 04:15.190
But if you look at places like Jiangxi,

04:15.190 --> 04:15.910
Guangdong and Guangxi,

04:15.910 --> 04:17.240
and Shanxi and Shaanxi,

04:17.269 --> 04:18.950
they have insufficient
natural salt reserves

04:18.950 --> 04:20.120
and have high salt prices.

04:20.120 --> 04:21.579
But their food

04:21.800 --> 04:23.510
consists mostly of preserved

04:23.630 --> 04:24.630
and smoked food,

04:24.870 --> 04:26.360
requiring large amounts of salt.

04:26.360 --> 04:28.700
Since we're opening a salt shop,

04:28.800 --> 04:29.480
why not

04:29.870 --> 04:31.330
open in these places?

04:32.820 --> 04:33.820
That makes sense.

04:34.240 --> 04:35.830
The salt licenses from Lianghuai

04:35.830 --> 04:37.790
also bear the Qing seal.

04:38.159 --> 04:38.830
Moreover,

04:38.870 --> 04:40.600
the ban on provincial monopolies

04:40.600 --> 04:41.730
has been abolished.

04:42.159 --> 04:44.159
As the saying goes,
businessmen should travel the world.

04:44.159 --> 04:45.480
Staying in one province

04:45.480 --> 04:46.940
is being too restrictive.

04:47.730 --> 04:48.600
I understand now.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.840
Are you taking us

04:49.870 --> 04:51.360
to do transprovincial business?

04:51.360 --> 04:52.970
If Li Wantang can cross the Yangtze River

04:52.970 --> 04:54.800
to acquire our Lianghuai salt fields,

04:54.800 --> 04:55.630
what's so special

04:55.630 --> 04:56.830
about what I'm doing?

04:56.830 --> 04:58.690
If we had thought of this earlier,

04:58.800 --> 05:00.410
why would we have been at odds

05:00.480 --> 05:01.540
with Li for so long?

05:01.950 --> 05:03.190
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.400
This solution

05:05.070 --> 05:06.470
has been there all along.

05:07.830 --> 05:08.600
If he hadn't pushed me

05:08.600 --> 05:09.510
to the edge,

05:10.630 --> 05:12.890
I wouldn't want to deal with him this way.

05:14.690 --> 05:16.040
I don't even want

05:16.070 --> 05:17.070
to be the Viceroy of Liangjiang anymore.

05:17.070 --> 05:18.930
Let's go make a fortune together.

05:20.240 --> 05:21.110
Sir.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.270
If you're done looking at it,

05:22.270 --> 05:23.470
please let me go home.

05:23.720 --> 05:25.360
My family is still in mourning.

05:25.360 --> 05:26.650
How could you be like this?

05:26.650 --> 05:28.690
It's fine, it's fine.

05:29.190 --> 05:29.830
If not now,

05:29.830 --> 05:30.960
I'll go back with you

05:31.390 --> 05:33.040
to pay respects to Old Madam Gu.

05:33.040 --> 05:34.920
What could she possibly say about me?

05:34.920 --> 05:37.520
You're just taking advantage
of my abilities.

05:40.430 --> 05:41.690
Is Gu in there?

05:53.920 --> 05:55.560
All the filial sons in the world

05:55.560 --> 05:56.720
are reporting here.

05:57.120 --> 05:58.050
Young Master Li,

05:58.600 --> 06:01.630
weren't you going to come
only after the seventh day of mourning?

06:01.630 --> 06:02.120
Sir,

06:02.800 --> 06:04.530
I'm here to check the accounts.

06:08.310 --> 06:08.800
Sure.

06:12.040 --> 06:12.590
Go ahead.

06:13.120 --> 06:13.980
Take your time.

06:23.240 --> 06:24.370
You stay right here.

06:25.640 --> 06:26.310
Guards!

06:26.720 --> 06:27.480
-Yes!
-Yes!

06:28.510 --> 06:29.830
Guard the door carefully.

06:29.830 --> 06:31.290
Sharpen your blades well.

06:31.480 --> 06:33.690
No one can leave today.

06:33.830 --> 06:34.690
They can leave,

06:34.830 --> 06:35.830
but not alive.

06:36.260 --> 06:37.030
Yes, sir!

06:47.950 --> 06:49.159
Your idea

06:49.630 --> 06:50.600
is excellent.

06:51.070 --> 06:51.870
Some days ago,

06:52.159 --> 06:54.240
I also submitted
a memorial to the imperial court

06:54.240 --> 06:55.970
requesting to build railways.

06:56.310 --> 06:58.120
Once goods can circulate freely,

06:58.120 --> 06:59.560
and merchants can trade everywhere,

06:59.560 --> 07:01.290
our people will become wealthy

07:01.390 --> 07:03.520
and commoners will live better lives.

07:04.750 --> 07:08.550
The imperial court is planning to establish
a Ministry of Commerce.

07:08.720 --> 07:09.710
I think

07:09.920 --> 07:11.800
the Minister of Commerce...

07:12.120 --> 07:13.120
Sir, if you continue this talk,

07:13.120 --> 07:15.160
I'll bash my head
against the wall right now.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.430
Being such a minor official

07:16.430 --> 07:17.140
has already exhausted me

07:17.140 --> 07:18.360
to the point of vomiting and diarrhea.

07:18.360 --> 07:20.430
And now you want me
to go serve as an official in the capital?

07:20.430 --> 07:22.030
You might as well kill me now.

07:23.000 --> 07:24.260
Didn't we agree

07:24.560 --> 07:26.560
that once I help you
accomplish this matter,

07:26.560 --> 07:28.360
you would let me return to Anhui?

07:29.190 --> 07:29.990
How can you...

07:30.310 --> 07:31.950
How can you have no ambition

07:31.950 --> 07:32.870
at all?

07:34.040 --> 07:34.870
This regime

07:36.000 --> 07:37.330
is not one for business.

07:38.830 --> 07:40.760
We're different from foreigners.

07:46.040 --> 07:48.210
That's insightful.

07:48.870 --> 07:50.070
To be honest with you,

07:50.360 --> 07:52.950
I've been telling the imperial court
the same thing.

07:52.950 --> 07:54.510
I said we can't keep clinging to

07:54.510 --> 07:56.190
Mencius's old doctrines anymore.

07:56.190 --> 07:57.550
Always going on about

07:57.570 --> 07:58.920
righteousness versus profit,

07:58.920 --> 08:00.720
and gentlemen versus petty men.

08:01.040 --> 08:02.720
People are doing business with us

08:02.720 --> 08:03.480
holding guns

08:03.500 --> 08:04.580
and cannons.

08:04.830 --> 08:06.120
Yet here we are, still talking to them

08:06.120 --> 08:07.070
about Confucius and Mencius foolishly.

08:07.070 --> 08:08.730
Do you think this makes sense?

08:10.560 --> 08:12.000
The Minister of Commerce

08:12.270 --> 08:14.350
is a high-ranking official.

08:14.600 --> 08:16.480
If you're lucky,

08:16.600 --> 08:17.680
in just a few years,

08:18.390 --> 08:19.980
you'll be my equal.

08:21.560 --> 08:22.600
What's good about

08:22.630 --> 08:24.360
being in a position like yours?

08:25.360 --> 08:26.390
Aren't you just worried every day

08:26.390 --> 08:27.720
about your own fortune?

08:28.720 --> 08:30.380
I don't have that confidence.

08:30.670 --> 08:31.240
Sir.

08:31.830 --> 08:33.130
I'm just a man with no ambition.

08:33.130 --> 08:33.669
No,

08:33.960 --> 08:34.789
you're not.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.490
Alright, that's for later.

08:37.510 --> 08:38.909
We don't need to discuss it now.

08:38.909 --> 08:39.549
However,

08:40.480 --> 08:42.809
in reorganizing the Salt Industry Guild,

08:42.960 --> 08:45.220
your contribution has been tremendous.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.000
I plan

08:46.030 --> 08:47.750
to give you 20%

08:48.120 --> 08:49.510
of the Salt Industry Guild shares.

08:49.510 --> 08:50.670
Aren't you happy?

08:51.600 --> 08:52.030
Sir.

08:52.980 --> 08:54.780
The outcome is still uncertain.

09:03.950 --> 09:05.680
Well, Young Master Li,

09:06.320 --> 09:08.320
have you finished reviewing the accounts?

09:08.320 --> 09:09.870
There's only one month left.

09:09.870 --> 09:11.330
You can't turn the tables.

09:11.670 --> 09:12.150
Sir.

09:12.870 --> 09:13.270
I...

09:14.080 --> 09:14.620
It's okay.

09:14.620 --> 09:16.200
It's fine
if you haven't finished checking it.

09:16.200 --> 09:17.440
I've already had someone

09:17.440 --> 09:18.720
to make a copy of the ledger

09:18.720 --> 09:20.510
and deliver it to your residence.

09:20.510 --> 09:24.110
Take your time reviewing
it before your seventh day of mourning.

09:35.180 --> 09:38.190
After that, I will go collect my debt.

09:47.980 --> 09:51.790
[Ancestral Spirit Tablet of Qing Dynasty's
Esteemed Li Wantang]

10:24.970 --> 10:28.520
[Ancestral Spirit Tablet of Qing Dynasty's
Esteemed Li Wantang]

10:33.020 --> 10:36.710
[Ancestral Spirit Tablet of Qing Dynasty's
Esteemed Li Wantang]

10:48.530 --> 10:50.770
[Ancestral Spirit Tablet of Qing Dynasty's
Esteemed Li Wantang]

11:28.320 --> 11:32.400
[Shanghai Xianghe Trade House]

11:49.000 --> 11:50.600
Friends have come from afar.

11:50.960 --> 11:51.550
Mr. Li.

11:52.630 --> 11:53.270
Please.

11:55.080 --> 12:00.510
[Xianghe Trade House]

12:01.650 --> 12:02.270
Well,

12:02.600 --> 12:03.870
have different views

12:03.910 --> 12:04.970
on the collateral.

12:05.670 --> 12:06.960
Regarding the mortgage,

12:06.960 --> 12:07.720
both parties

12:07.750 --> 12:09.210
have different opinions.

12:11.520 --> 12:13.650
Is it about the valuation

12:13.910 --> 12:15.710
or about the collateral itself?

12:19.210 --> 12:20.760
We have no doubts

12:20.790 --> 12:22.320
about the collateral itself.

12:22.320 --> 12:23.260
The sixty-some shops

12:23.260 --> 12:24.480
that Mr. Li has offered,

12:24.480 --> 12:25.270
we believe

12:25.270 --> 12:27.180
are all profitable assets.

12:27.840 --> 12:29.510
But the issue is

12:29.790 --> 12:32.650
there are too many
official connections involved.

12:33.440 --> 12:34.320
Quality assets

12:35.120 --> 12:36.270
are called quality assets

12:36.270 --> 12:37.510
for a reason.

12:38.150 --> 12:39.120
Mr. Richard,

12:39.120 --> 12:40.580
after all your years here,

12:40.720 --> 12:42.520
you must surely understand that

12:42.870 --> 12:43.790
in the Great Qing,

12:43.790 --> 12:45.630
a business without official backing

12:45.630 --> 12:46.360
that grows too large

12:46.360 --> 12:47.360
is nothing more than

12:47.360 --> 12:48.360
a useless fat pig.

12:49.200 --> 12:49.910
All these dozens of shops

12:49.910 --> 12:50.960
that I'm offering

12:51.440 --> 12:53.700
have government banks as shareholders.

12:53.790 --> 12:54.550
So using these assets

12:54.550 --> 12:55.390
as collateral

12:55.910 --> 12:57.110
is the most secure

12:57.390 --> 12:58.790
and trustworthy option.

13:02.940 --> 13:04.440
When it comes to doing business,

13:04.440 --> 13:05.680
the British Empire

13:05.840 --> 13:06.770
is open-minded.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.320
We have always believed

13:08.320 --> 13:10.200
that business knows no borders.

13:12.480 --> 13:13.440
We once intended

13:13.440 --> 13:14.910
to invest in China's salt industry,

13:14.910 --> 13:15.870
textile industry,

13:15.870 --> 13:17.430
and even the food industry,

13:17.910 --> 13:19.310
as well as to help restore

13:19.320 --> 13:21.120
the development of Liangjiang.

13:22.390 --> 13:23.710
You know those

13:23.910 --> 13:25.480
narrow-minded officials
with braided queues—

13:25.480 --> 13:26.200
they always

13:26.240 --> 13:27.390
maliciously speculate

13:27.390 --> 13:28.850
that we would be invaders.

13:29.120 --> 13:31.250
But in fact, that's not the case at all.

13:31.790 --> 13:32.920
Xianghe Trade House

13:33.000 --> 13:34.930
is willing to help you

13:34.960 --> 13:37.240
to build your own salt industry empire.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.550
For this, we are ready to provide

13:39.550 --> 13:40.480
all funds

13:41.270 --> 13:43.480
as well as assistance beyond funding.

13:45.870 --> 13:47.870
What is assistance beyond funding?

13:48.840 --> 13:50.320
What do you mean by

13:50.320 --> 13:52.030
assistance beyond funding?

13:52.390 --> 13:54.390
Assistance beyond the funding,

13:54.440 --> 13:56.440
refers to the warships and gunboats

13:56.600 --> 13:57.510
anchored in the

13:57.790 --> 13:59.030
Huangpu river.

14:02.390 --> 14:03.990
Assistance beyond funding,

14:04.670 --> 14:05.270
are the

14:05.550 --> 14:07.880
warships stationed in the Huangpu River.

14:11.990 --> 14:13.450
Ask him to get to the point.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.930
Make the point, please.

14:15.390 --> 14:16.430
Yes, yes.

14:16.870 --> 14:18.200
Let's get back to the point.

14:18.200 --> 14:20.080
So, if we provide

14:20.480 --> 14:22.720
all necessary funding to Mr. Li...

14:23.190 --> 14:24.960
If we provide this funding

14:25.080 --> 14:26.310
to you,

14:26.390 --> 14:27.150
there will naturally be

14:27.150 --> 14:28.790
British Empire's gunboats

14:29.030 --> 14:30.630
and warships to remind them.

14:31.440 --> 14:33.110
While protecting Mr. Li,

14:33.360 --> 14:35.820
they're also protecting their investment.

14:44.700 --> 14:48.020
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

14:47.080 --> 14:49.630
I will not compromise on this issue.

14:50.360 --> 14:51.750
Mr. Richard says

14:51.840 --> 14:52.870
that he will not

14:52.870 --> 14:54.320
compromise on this matter.

14:54.320 --> 14:56.570
He believes that free and open commerce

14:57.000 --> 14:59.600
should not be limited
by national boundaries.

15:02.080 --> 15:03.140
Speaking of which,

15:03.390 --> 15:04.080
Mr. Richard

15:04.080 --> 15:05.210
also wants to open

15:05.240 --> 15:05.870
a branch of

15:05.960 --> 15:08.160
Xianghe Trading Company in Jiangning.

15:09.440 --> 15:10.840
He is very pleased

15:10.910 --> 15:12.570
to be your neighbor, Viceroy.

15:14.630 --> 15:17.390
I have no desire to have
a stinky foreigner as my neighbor.

15:17.390 --> 15:18.650
Don't translate this.

15:21.360 --> 15:22.720
Has Gu Pingyuan arrived?

15:22.720 --> 15:23.510
I've sent someone to find him.

15:23.510 --> 15:25.390
He's asking where Gu is.

15:28.840 --> 15:30.440
Regarding what you just mentioned,

15:30.440 --> 15:32.640
I cannot make a decision at this moment.

15:33.600 --> 15:35.050
You say that Li Qin

15:35.080 --> 15:37.550
has already mortgaged half

15:37.550 --> 15:39.790
of the Liangjiang salt industry shares
to you.

15:39.790 --> 15:40.990
I cannot believe this

15:41.120 --> 15:43.410
until I hear it

15:43.630 --> 15:44.870
from him personally.

15:47.320 --> 15:49.620
Even if I believe it,

15:50.030 --> 15:51.390
whether the imperial court

15:51.390 --> 15:53.390
would agree to open

15:53.390 --> 15:54.910
the salt industry to foreign countries

15:54.910 --> 15:58.080
is something I must report

15:58.240 --> 15:59.240
to the Emperor and

15:59.240 --> 16:00.440
the Empress Dowager.

16:03.320 --> 16:05.170
Therefore, I suggest

16:05.360 --> 16:07.090
that he should go to the capital

16:07.200 --> 16:09.030
and the Office of General Management

16:09.030 --> 16:10.000
to seek advice.

16:15.390 --> 16:16.910
Before coming, he already knew

16:16.910 --> 16:19.080
you would pass the buck

16:19.080 --> 16:21.080
and send this matter to the capital.

16:21.630 --> 16:23.150
This is the typical practice

16:23.150 --> 16:24.350
of Qing bureaucracy.

16:38.670 --> 16:39.800
Have you seen Mr. Gu?

16:40.000 --> 16:40.930
He's over there.

16:45.270 --> 16:47.400
I've been looking for you everywhere.

16:47.790 --> 16:48.910
If I still can't find you,

16:48.910 --> 16:51.440
the Viceroy's Office
would have arrested me.

16:52.920 --> 16:53.510
Let's go.

16:53.630 --> 16:56.160
The Viceroy of Liangjiang
is waiting for you.

16:56.480 --> 16:58.080
What use could I possibly be?

17:00.200 --> 17:02.130
Such a major incident has happened

17:02.150 --> 17:03.080
and those bloodsuckers

17:03.080 --> 17:03.910
wearing red official hats,

17:03.910 --> 17:04.970
have no solutions.

17:06.030 --> 17:07.200
How can they expect common people like us

17:07.200 --> 17:08.460
to have any solutions?

17:15.750 --> 17:16.349
How could he

17:16.349 --> 17:17.240
do such a thing?

17:18.550 --> 17:19.380
That bastard,

17:19.480 --> 17:21.540
he's nothing but a national traitor.

17:28.510 --> 17:29.750
That's not what I meant.

17:29.750 --> 17:31.350
That's exactly what I meant.

17:31.550 --> 17:32.480
I am cursing him,

17:32.790 --> 17:33.850
that darn traitor.

17:38.190 --> 17:41.150
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

17:39.750 --> 17:40.270
Sir.

17:42.750 --> 17:43.350
Sir!

18:01.240 --> 18:01.720
Sir.

18:06.240 --> 18:07.640
I've quit for many years.

18:08.310 --> 18:09.070
Would you like

18:09.070 --> 18:09.830
a puff?

18:10.160 --> 18:10.960
No, thanks.

18:14.350 --> 18:15.010
Have a seat.

18:16.230 --> 18:17.750
You're lucky.

18:18.350 --> 18:20.010
I've already vented my anger.

18:21.400 --> 18:22.530
Where have you been?

18:22.550 --> 18:23.750
I went to inspect the salt fields.

18:23.750 --> 18:25.880
I've just returned from Xiaguan Dock.

18:26.240 --> 18:27.900
Did you see the British ships?

18:30.480 --> 18:32.000
Last time they came

18:32.000 --> 18:33.680
it was when Commissioner Lin

18:34.240 --> 18:35.480
fought a battle with them

18:35.480 --> 18:37.270
in Guangzhou over opium.

18:39.480 --> 18:41.000
What should we do now?

18:41.440 --> 18:43.640
We've brought trouble upon ourselves.

18:45.920 --> 18:46.590
I

18:47.310 --> 18:49.460
should have arrested Li Qin earlier.

18:49.880 --> 18:51.700
I was too soft-hearted,

18:51.750 --> 18:53.960
waiting for his mourning period to be over.

18:53.960 --> 18:54.880
I didn't expect

18:55.070 --> 18:56.740
he was so agitated

18:56.790 --> 18:57.920
he became a traitor.

18:59.680 --> 19:00.110
Sir.

19:01.350 --> 19:03.150
The situation is different now.

19:03.640 --> 19:05.100
If it were just Li Million,

19:05.790 --> 19:07.520
no matter how hard he tried

19:07.590 --> 19:09.240
to monopolize the salt industry

19:09.240 --> 19:10.310
in Lianghuai,

19:10.830 --> 19:11.790
you're the governor.

19:11.790 --> 19:13.330
You could simply refuse

19:13.420 --> 19:15.240
and he would have no grounds to object.

19:15.240 --> 19:16.480
But now we're dealing with

19:16.480 --> 19:17.400
the British.

19:18.270 --> 19:20.400
We need to come up with an explanation.

19:20.510 --> 19:20.920
Yes.

19:21.720 --> 19:22.650
I had someone look into

19:22.650 --> 19:24.550
the Elements of International Law.

19:24.550 --> 19:25.260
A country

19:25.350 --> 19:27.720
can declare important commodities

19:28.300 --> 19:29.520
as state monopolies.

19:31.200 --> 19:32.270
I've sent someone with the book

19:32.270 --> 19:33.750
to ride quickly to the capital

19:33.750 --> 19:35.330
and deliver it
to the Office of General Management.

19:35.330 --> 19:36.480
Now we'll see

19:37.110 --> 19:38.680
if they can help me

19:38.720 --> 19:39.960
stop this mess.

19:42.310 --> 19:43.310
What should we do?

19:44.590 --> 19:46.790
We really screwed up this time.

19:51.960 --> 19:53.760
Why aren't you saying anything?

19:54.310 --> 19:56.440
You're the Viceroy of Liangjiang,
a high official,

19:56.440 --> 19:57.350
and you have no ideas.

19:57.350 --> 19:59.350
Yet you ask me to think of something?

20:00.000 --> 20:01.930
I was trying to

20:01.960 --> 20:03.290
protect your business.

20:07.510 --> 20:08.160
Sir.

20:08.640 --> 20:09.820
Let me be honest.

20:10.790 --> 20:11.990
This is not

20:12.070 --> 20:13.530
how merchants should act.

20:14.640 --> 20:15.550
Either you're

20:15.920 --> 20:17.720
relying on your official position

20:17.720 --> 20:18.780
to pressure others

20:19.350 --> 20:20.750
and do whatever you want,

20:21.240 --> 20:22.680
or you're constantly giving in—

20:22.680 --> 20:23.680
always backing down.

20:23.680 --> 20:25.960
If you want to do business
with the British,

20:25.960 --> 20:26.750
this approach

20:26.750 --> 20:27.810
simply won't work.

20:30.830 --> 20:32.900
We're just too weak.

20:33.160 --> 20:33.960
Do you believe

20:34.310 --> 20:35.910
if I had 10 ironclad warships

20:36.030 --> 20:37.750
like those,

20:38.160 --> 20:40.480
no one would dare speak to me like this?

20:40.920 --> 20:41.480
You...

20:47.110 --> 20:48.110
Mr. Li,

20:49.440 --> 20:51.370
why are you sitting in the shadows?

20:56.200 --> 20:58.000
It's more comfortable this way.

21:03.400 --> 21:04.110
Whiskey.

21:09.640 --> 21:10.480
Much better.

21:11.550 --> 21:12.550
There you go, Sir.

21:12.960 --> 21:13.750
Thank you.

21:16.070 --> 21:16.880
Cheers.

21:20.880 --> 21:22.510
That sneaky old man

21:22.640 --> 21:23.480
has given in.

21:24.200 --> 21:25.710
That sly old fox

21:25.750 --> 21:26.680
has backed down.

21:28.480 --> 21:29.480
He's backed down?

21:30.720 --> 21:32.330
Not surrendering—

21:32.400 --> 21:34.240
probably just being polite.

21:35.310 --> 21:37.020
This is just the beginning.

21:40.720 --> 21:42.850
He'll get increasingly cooperative.

21:43.160 --> 21:44.480
It's just the beginning.

21:44.480 --> 21:47.030
Surely he will be more and more compliant.

21:48.000 --> 21:48.550
Best do.

21:50.160 --> 21:51.160
More whiskey!

21:51.880 --> 21:54.310
The talks actually didn't go so well.

21:54.640 --> 21:59.030
That old bastard was acting like
he was playing Taichi with me.

21:59.640 --> 22:01.110
He just won't admit.

22:02.260 --> 22:03.320
Mr. Richard thinks

22:03.350 --> 22:05.210
the negotiations didn't go well.

22:05.640 --> 22:07.900
That old man is really good
at dodging issues

22:07.900 --> 22:09.760
and refuses to admit to anything.

22:10.560 --> 22:12.560
He insists on meeting you in person.

22:13.110 --> 22:15.090
But even if he meets you,

22:15.160 --> 22:17.240
he will still consult with the Emperor

22:17.240 --> 22:18.770
and the Empress Dowager.

22:19.110 --> 22:20.440
Didn't your consul

22:21.240 --> 22:23.350
already go to the capital

22:24.200 --> 22:25.400
to see the Emperor and Empress Dowager

22:25.400 --> 22:26.660
to resolve this issue?

22:28.350 --> 22:29.240
These people

22:29.640 --> 22:31.770
from the Office of General Management

22:32.750 --> 22:34.350
are even better at stalling.

22:38.830 --> 22:40.420
But they still

22:40.480 --> 22:41.800
have many ways

22:41.830 --> 22:42.720
to break their promises.

22:42.720 --> 22:44.500
For example, the signing date

22:44.750 --> 22:46.680
is being postponed indefinitely.

22:49.590 --> 22:51.010
The British Empire now

22:51.200 --> 22:52.550
has nothing but opium

22:52.590 --> 22:54.040
to wage war

22:54.070 --> 22:55.160
with.

22:57.030 --> 22:58.960
This isn't exactly profiteering.

22:59.410 --> 23:01.070
How is this not profiteering?

23:01.270 --> 23:02.830
Is it really not so?

23:05.590 --> 23:06.920
It's such a huge country

23:08.270 --> 23:10.630
with so many people consuming salt.

23:12.270 --> 23:14.440
My father spent 10 years

23:14.510 --> 23:16.410
to gain control of only one-fifth

23:16.440 --> 23:17.970
of Qing's salt industry.

23:19.310 --> 23:21.770
You're telling me this isn't profiteering?

23:23.680 --> 23:27.210
And you're telling me
this is not a highly profitable industry?

23:37.200 --> 23:38.000
Mr. Li.

23:39.790 --> 23:40.880
Mr. Richard says

23:40.920 --> 23:42.860
you are a very valuable person.

23:43.240 --> 23:46.760
But if you make one step off this ship,

23:46.960 --> 23:48.960
even the British Empire

23:48.980 --> 23:50.110
will not guarantee

23:50.110 --> 23:51.030
your safety.

23:53.690 --> 23:54.960
He says if you

23:55.540 --> 23:57.070
take one step off this ship,

23:57.240 --> 23:58.570
even the British Empire

23:59.040 --> 24:00.200
cannot guarantee

24:00.200 --> 24:01.030
your safety.

24:07.590 --> 24:08.850
When the time is right,

24:11.550 --> 24:13.440
I will turn myself in.

24:15.150 --> 24:20.190
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

24:15.720 --> 24:16.650
Imperial Edict:

24:17.000 --> 24:17.750
it has come to our attention

24:17.750 --> 24:20.310
that the British envoy holds deeds
to the Lianghuai salt fields

24:20.310 --> 24:23.350
[Imperial Edict]

24:20.440 --> 24:21.750
and has approached
the Office of General Management

24:21.750 --> 24:23.480
to negotiate payment.

24:23.790 --> 24:26.180
I am utterly shocked by this news.

24:26.550 --> 24:27.550
The salt industry

24:27.640 --> 24:29.990
is vital to our nation's economy
and people's livelihood.

24:29.840 --> 24:33.400
[Imperial Edict]

24:30.200 --> 24:31.750
How dare you

24:31.790 --> 24:33.570
negotiate such matters with foreigners?

24:33.520 --> 24:38.270
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

24:33.830 --> 24:34.400
Viceroy,

24:34.590 --> 24:36.790
report back with full details immediately.

24:36.790 --> 24:38.030
By Imperial Order.

24:38.640 --> 24:41.320
I humbly receive the Emperor's edict.

24:41.310 --> 24:44.100
[Loyal to the Country, Just in Duty]

24:41.440 --> 24:43.350
Long live the Emperor!

24:50.790 --> 24:52.990
Are the Emperor and the Empress Dowager

24:53.070 --> 24:55.060
still angry?

24:54.950 --> 24:59.450
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

24:55.640 --> 24:57.040
The Empress Dowager said

24:57.160 --> 24:58.210
that Jiangnan

24:58.270 --> 24:59.800
has been in chaos for years.

25:00.000 --> 25:01.260
Such a thing happening

25:01.310 --> 25:02.710
is not surprising at all.

25:02.750 --> 25:03.880
Her Majesty is wise.

25:03.880 --> 25:05.620
The Empress Dowager is wise.

25:06.310 --> 25:07.720
The Empress Dowager also said

25:07.720 --> 25:08.720
that these land deeds

25:08.720 --> 25:10.590
originally belonged to us Chinese,

25:10.590 --> 25:11.510
so how did they end up

25:11.510 --> 25:12.770
in foreigners' hands?

25:13.680 --> 25:15.590
If the Viceroy of Liangjiang doesn't know,

25:15.590 --> 25:17.850
then are all the officials in Liangjiang

25:17.880 --> 25:18.680
blind

25:18.880 --> 25:19.890
and dead?

25:21.200 --> 25:21.720
Well...

25:21.960 --> 25:24.190
That's real fury indeed!

25:24.830 --> 25:26.830
However,
the Empress Dowager also mentioned

25:26.830 --> 25:27.680
that most likely

25:27.680 --> 25:28.920
there are traitors at work.

25:28.920 --> 25:29.270
Yes.

25:29.480 --> 25:31.200
Oversight can happen sometimes.

25:31.200 --> 25:31.930
Yes, indeed.

25:32.000 --> 25:32.810
Rui Lin

25:32.920 --> 25:34.110
is experienced in state affairs.

25:34.110 --> 25:35.270
If he handles this,

25:35.440 --> 25:37.270
there will certainly be no problems.

25:37.270 --> 25:37.860
See how

25:37.960 --> 25:39.680
Liangjiang has been managed so well

25:39.680 --> 25:41.080
in just such a short time.

25:41.920 --> 25:43.110
The Empress Dowager is wise.

25:43.110 --> 25:43.750
Wise indeed.

25:43.750 --> 25:44.960
The Empress Dowager is wise.

25:44.960 --> 25:46.090
The foreigners said

25:46.200 --> 25:47.600
that this must be settled

25:47.640 --> 25:48.840
within a month.

25:49.240 --> 25:49.980
Last time,

25:50.070 --> 25:51.730
the imperial court still owed

25:51.750 --> 25:52.960
war reparations

25:53.030 --> 25:54.550
of 16 million taels.

25:55.160 --> 25:56.080
These British

25:56.110 --> 25:58.350
have been constantly pressing for payment.

25:58.350 --> 25:59.470
If it's not settled

25:59.510 --> 26:00.540
within a month,

26:00.640 --> 26:02.500
then all officials in Liangjiang

26:02.510 --> 26:04.510
will have
their personal assets confiscated

26:04.510 --> 26:05.350
to pay compensation.

26:05.350 --> 26:05.810
This...

26:06.000 --> 26:06.460
This...

26:06.490 --> 26:07.960
[Clear Mirror Hung High]

26:06.590 --> 26:07.070
This...

26:07.160 --> 26:07.890
Sir, this...

26:08.680 --> 26:09.170
Sir...

26:09.200 --> 26:09.760
This...

26:09.790 --> 26:10.830
Sir, what should we do?

26:10.830 --> 26:11.830
What should we do?

26:12.200 --> 26:14.330
Please go upstairs to rest first, Sir.

26:14.640 --> 26:15.680
I will certainly

26:15.680 --> 26:17.200
resolve this within the time limit.

26:17.200 --> 26:18.240
I won't let the Emperor

26:18.240 --> 26:20.040
and the Empress Dowager worry.

26:21.480 --> 26:22.160
Please.

26:22.390 --> 26:23.970
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

26:23.110 --> 26:23.790
Please.

26:32.070 --> 26:32.550
Sir.

26:32.750 --> 26:33.210
Sir.

26:33.640 --> 26:34.130
Sir.

26:34.880 --> 26:35.680
Sir, take it slowly.

26:35.680 --> 26:36.540
-Slowly.
-Sir.

26:36.960 --> 26:37.400
Be careful.

26:37.400 --> 26:38.330
Slowly, slowly.

26:39.310 --> 26:40.710
What should I do?

26:40.830 --> 26:42.060
What should I do?

26:43.270 --> 26:43.850
Tell me.

26:43.960 --> 26:44.350
I...

26:44.440 --> 26:45.130
Tell me!

26:45.160 --> 26:45.590
Sir.

26:46.110 --> 26:46.920
That fellow is hiding

26:46.920 --> 26:48.070
on a British ironclad ship.

26:48.070 --> 26:49.280
We can't touch him.

26:49.440 --> 26:50.270
That's right, Sir.

26:50.270 --> 26:51.200
We can't do anything.

26:51.200 --> 26:51.560
Yes.

26:51.590 --> 26:52.120
We can't.

26:52.200 --> 26:53.130
We really can't.

26:53.640 --> 26:54.550
Go.

26:57.550 --> 26:58.900
This is your brother.

26:59.000 --> 27:00.110
Can you find a way

27:00.160 --> 27:01.160
to get him to come down?

27:01.160 --> 27:01.960
How can I persuade him?

27:01.960 --> 27:02.420
Well...

27:04.240 --> 27:05.310
I'll apologize to him.

27:05.310 --> 27:07.480
I'll hand over the
Lianghuai's salt industry to him.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.550
As long as these things

27:08.550 --> 27:11.010
don't fall into the hands
of the Westerners!

27:11.030 --> 27:12.830
I can grant him an official position.

27:12.830 --> 27:13.960
You figure out a way.

27:14.030 --> 27:15.810
Give him whatever he wants.

27:16.000 --> 27:17.330
What if he just hates me?

27:19.830 --> 27:20.720
Go.

27:21.030 --> 27:21.400
Go.

27:22.920 --> 27:23.640
Go.

27:24.370 --> 27:26.370
[Righteous and Diligent]

27:27.510 --> 27:30.100
[Clear Mirror Hung High]

27:30.190 --> 27:38.280
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

27:33.920 --> 27:34.790
Tell me.

27:35.270 --> 27:36.890
How can we trick

27:36.920 --> 27:38.450
your brother off that ship?

27:38.590 --> 27:39.400
Trick him down?

27:39.400 --> 27:39.940
Yes.

27:40.030 --> 27:41.480
As long as he comes down

27:41.680 --> 27:42.290
here.

27:42.920 --> 27:44.740
He's Li Million's son.

27:45.240 --> 27:47.030
That's a lot of inheritance
we are talking about.

27:47.030 --> 27:48.160
I can confiscate

27:48.160 --> 27:49.650
all of his property.

27:49.750 --> 27:51.320
I can exile him.

27:51.440 --> 27:53.550
I can kill him.

27:54.240 --> 27:54.970
How about it?

27:55.270 --> 27:56.410
I'll give you

27:56.440 --> 27:57.830
everything Li Million has.

27:57.830 --> 27:59.310
How's that reward?

28:00.720 --> 28:01.750
Where are you going?

28:01.750 --> 28:02.240
Sir,

28:03.160 --> 28:05.290
I'm afraid you're overthinking this.

28:05.400 --> 28:05.960
This brother of mine

28:05.960 --> 28:07.160
may not be very smart,

28:07.310 --> 28:08.310
but since he dared to do

28:08.310 --> 28:09.510
something like this,

28:09.550 --> 28:11.720
he's already considered
all the consequences.

28:11.720 --> 28:12.780
What you're saying

28:13.480 --> 28:14.140
is useless.

28:14.160 --> 28:15.770
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

28:14.270 --> 28:14.670
You...

28:15.890 --> 28:19.940
[Righteous and Diligent]

28:20.310 --> 28:21.550
I don't believe it.

28:22.690 --> 28:25.010
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

28:48.960 --> 28:49.680
Mr. Li,

28:50.440 --> 28:51.410
I am...

28:51.480 --> 28:52.160
I know.

28:52.880 --> 28:53.960
Mr. Tu.

28:56.000 --> 28:57.730
Head of the Salt Industry Guild

28:58.830 --> 29:01.090
and salt merchant magnate of Lianghuai.

29:03.550 --> 29:04.210
Please sit.

29:10.860 --> 29:12.060
This chair is so soft.

29:16.160 --> 29:16.690
Speak.

29:22.550 --> 29:23.250
Mr. Li,

29:24.160 --> 29:25.130
I've come on

29:25.160 --> 29:27.030
the Viceroy of Liangjiang's orders

29:27.030 --> 29:28.290
to have a talk with you.

29:28.590 --> 29:29.320
Previously,

29:29.350 --> 29:30.510
there might have been
some misunderstandings.

29:30.510 --> 29:32.240
There's no misunderstanding.

29:33.350 --> 29:35.550
What misunderstanding could there be?

29:35.640 --> 29:37.070
He is the Viceroy,

29:37.960 --> 29:39.620
and I'm just a small merchant.

29:41.310 --> 29:43.880
If there's any misunderstanding,
it must be my fault.

29:43.880 --> 29:44.400
No, no.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.370
He says it's his fault.

29:46.720 --> 29:47.350
He says

29:47.830 --> 29:49.830
as long as you're willing to come ashore,

29:49.830 --> 29:50.960
he'll agree to

29:51.440 --> 29:52.840
any conditions you have.

29:54.200 --> 29:54.720
Really.

29:55.480 --> 29:56.000
Tell us,

29:56.430 --> 29:57.580
what official position would you like?

29:57.580 --> 29:58.370
No problem.

29:58.790 --> 29:59.920
Any position in Liangjiang,

29:59.920 --> 30:01.320
whichever one you fancy,

30:01.550 --> 30:02.550
we can discuss it.

30:03.000 --> 30:04.000
The Salt Industry Guild

30:04.000 --> 30:05.270
has also discussed this.

30:05.270 --> 30:06.640
As long as you're willing to come,

30:06.640 --> 30:07.200
Mr. Gu

30:07.590 --> 30:08.790
will return to Anhui.

30:09.270 --> 30:10.600
The Salt Industry Guild

30:10.680 --> 30:11.940
will treat you highly.

30:13.070 --> 30:14.230
I stake my life

30:14.310 --> 30:15.510
as a guarantee to you.

30:17.790 --> 30:18.990
Such sincerity, huh?

30:26.680 --> 30:27.790
Manager Gu

30:28.510 --> 30:30.040
has won a complete victory.

30:34.720 --> 30:36.650
Why would he be returning to Anhui?

30:37.240 --> 30:37.920
He said...

30:38.070 --> 30:38.930
What did he say?

30:43.350 --> 30:43.880
Speak up!

30:46.960 --> 30:47.550
He said

30:48.440 --> 30:49.370
that though salt

30:50.440 --> 30:51.840
may seem insignificant,

30:52.200 --> 30:53.930
it's essential for every meal.

30:54.270 --> 30:56.070
If foreigners get to control it,

30:57.590 --> 30:59.310
you'll be condemned by history,

30:59.310 --> 31:00.240
just like Qin Hui.

31:00.240 --> 31:02.370
He asks you to have some self-respect.

31:02.790 --> 31:04.110
These aren't my words.

31:11.920 --> 31:14.650
That sounds like something
my brother would say.

31:15.310 --> 31:16.110
But he's the kind of person

31:16.110 --> 31:17.680
who's just too serious.

31:18.410 --> 31:19.870
Take a message back for me.

31:20.160 --> 31:20.960
Please go ahead.

31:20.960 --> 31:22.290
I have just one request.

31:26.960 --> 31:27.440
Sir,

31:27.920 --> 31:28.980
Li Qin has replied?

31:30.370 --> 31:31.240
I had Tu Ying

31:31.270 --> 31:32.510
write down every word

31:32.510 --> 31:33.200
they said.

31:33.510 --> 31:34.510
Have a look.

31:34.720 --> 31:36.450
This is what your brother said.

31:37.400 --> 31:38.670
[Viceroy, Gu Pingyuan destroyed my family.]

31:38.690 --> 31:40.740
[He shouldn't have ever come back
from exile.]

31:39.070 --> 31:41.130
It was that friend of mine surnamed Gu

31:41.310 --> 31:42.940
who destroyed my family.

31:43.880 --> 31:46.540
He shouldn't have ever come back
from Ningguta.

31:48.030 --> 31:49.220
Tell Rui Lin

31:49.310 --> 31:49.920
if

31:51.240 --> 31:52.240
he can send Gu Pingyuan

31:52.240 --> 31:53.550
back to Ningguta

31:55.110 --> 31:57.000
and chain him up there like a dog

31:58.590 --> 31:59.920
for the rest of his life,

32:03.400 --> 32:05.130
I'll come ashore immediately.

32:15.400 --> 32:16.750
This is human nature—

32:17.350 --> 32:18.920
truly despicable.

32:22.110 --> 32:23.310
What do you plan to do?

32:25.380 --> 32:25.900
Look.

32:26.160 --> 32:26.920
You've done so much

32:26.920 --> 32:28.320
for Liangjiang.

32:28.550 --> 32:30.280
How could I agree to his demand?

32:31.030 --> 32:31.830
But now

32:32.400 --> 32:34.710
this problem isn't mine anymore.

32:35.110 --> 32:36.270
It's yours.

32:37.640 --> 32:38.070
I know.

32:38.720 --> 32:39.820
Then exile me.

32:40.480 --> 32:41.200
I'm tired of staying

32:41.200 --> 32:42.460
in Liangjiang anyway.

32:43.160 --> 32:43.820
Look at you,

32:44.510 --> 32:45.920
getting upset after just a few words.

32:45.920 --> 32:46.640
Your temper

32:46.640 --> 32:47.790
is worse than mine,

32:47.830 --> 32:49.310
the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

32:49.310 --> 32:50.240
Even if I had

32:50.270 --> 32:51.960
extraordinary abilities now,

32:51.960 --> 32:53.220
they would be useless.

32:53.310 --> 32:55.440
They have their cannons pointed at me.

32:56.030 --> 32:57.490
I absolutely cannot watch

32:57.750 --> 33:00.150
the salt industry fall into foreign hands.

33:01.720 --> 33:02.640
What if

33:02.640 --> 33:03.900
it still isn't settled

33:04.270 --> 33:05.350
after you exile me?

33:09.030 --> 33:10.350
You need to tell me the truth

33:10.350 --> 33:11.610
so I know where I stand.

33:13.070 --> 33:13.530
Well...

33:15.160 --> 33:16.720
Your brother can die, then.

33:18.030 --> 33:18.960
What if we still don't succeed

33:18.960 --> 33:20.290
even after killing him?

33:20.400 --> 33:21.710
Then I'll start a war!

33:22.200 --> 33:23.390
If our salt

33:23.510 --> 33:24.680
is controlled by foreigners,

33:24.680 --> 33:25.400
when I die,

33:25.400 --> 33:26.960
I won't be able to face my ancestors.

33:26.960 --> 33:28.890
This is from the bottom of my heart.

33:30.310 --> 33:30.820
Sir,

33:31.790 --> 33:33.440
I'll help you with this matter,

33:33.440 --> 33:34.770
but you must help me too.

33:35.960 --> 33:37.310
If I can't handle it,

33:37.750 --> 33:38.890
how can you?

33:39.030 --> 33:40.230
If I can't resolve it,

33:40.300 --> 33:41.420
I'll pack my things

33:41.640 --> 33:43.370
and return to Ningguta myself.

33:46.000 --> 33:48.070
Come, sit.

33:49.790 --> 33:50.560
Tell me

33:50.790 --> 33:51.990
how I should help you.

33:52.400 --> 33:53.590
Whether you agree to his demands or not,

33:53.590 --> 33:55.550
he will come ashore sooner or later.

33:55.550 --> 33:57.120
The key to this matter

33:57.270 --> 33:59.270
is that we can't proceed without him.

33:59.270 --> 34:00.680
After he gets off the ship,

34:00.680 --> 34:01.910
whether you kill him,

34:02.160 --> 34:03.620
confiscate his property,

34:04.030 --> 34:05.890
or offer him titles and promises,

34:06.110 --> 34:07.640
I think none of it will work.

34:08.630 --> 34:11.489
It's better to just honestly
take responsibility.

34:11.960 --> 34:12.760
I

34:13.150 --> 34:14.409
take responsibility?

34:15.320 --> 34:16.840
Have you lost your mind?

34:18.590 --> 34:19.840
How about I serve
as the Viceroy of Liangjiang

34:19.840 --> 34:20.639
for a few days?

34:21.320 --> 34:23.480
I'll be your proxy
and handle all negotiations.

34:23.480 --> 34:25.679
After it's done, let me return to Anhui.

34:27.150 --> 34:28.409
For the rest of my life,

34:28.760 --> 34:29.620
leave me alone.

34:30.840 --> 34:32.239
For the rest of your life?

34:33.550 --> 34:34.480
That's too long.

34:35.440 --> 34:36.510
Is that a yes or no?

34:38.670 --> 34:39.710
You're the Viceroy of Liangjiang,

34:39.710 --> 34:41.190
a leader among court officials.

34:41.190 --> 34:41.840
Can't you say something

34:41.840 --> 34:42.900
that I can believe?

34:49.710 --> 34:50.260
Fine.

34:50.590 --> 34:52.000
If you can make this happen,

34:52.000 --> 34:55.460
you'll have freedom to come and go
in Liangjiang as you please.

35:22.190 --> 35:23.060
Are you tired?

35:23.440 --> 35:25.370
If you are, go inside and take a nap.

35:25.550 --> 35:26.400
I'm not tired.

35:26.880 --> 35:27.630
It's so rare

35:27.670 --> 35:28.930
to have a meal with you.

35:29.360 --> 35:30.180
Who says so?

35:31.000 --> 35:33.110
Then I'll come back
to eat every day from now on.

35:33.110 --> 35:34.000
Please don't.

35:34.440 --> 35:36.970
If you don't find it annoying,
I certainly do.

35:38.190 --> 35:39.190
Where's Pingwen?

35:41.320 --> 35:42.980
What's wrong with you lately?

35:43.360 --> 35:45.000
Didn't Pingwen escort Mother's coffin

35:45.000 --> 35:45.880
back to Anhui?

35:47.110 --> 35:49.370
He won't be back to help until next month.

35:53.320 --> 35:54.320
Recently, things

35:54.960 --> 35:56.960
have been coming one after another.

35:57.190 --> 35:58.720
My head is about to explode.

36:00.550 --> 36:02.080
It's always been like this.

36:02.840 --> 36:06.370
Yet here you are,
talking about coming home for meals everyday.

36:08.670 --> 36:09.510
Li Qin has

36:10.360 --> 36:11.420
caused a huge mess.

36:13.710 --> 36:15.190
He mortgaged the Lianghuai salt fields

36:15.190 --> 36:16.280
to the British.

36:17.800 --> 36:18.920
Now the British have brought

36:18.920 --> 36:20.980
their gunboats to the Yangtze River.

36:21.590 --> 36:22.880
The work at the salt fields

36:22.880 --> 36:24.810
seems impossible to continue now.

36:26.280 --> 36:27.110
I think we don't need to wait for

36:27.110 --> 36:28.170
Pingwen to return.

36:28.960 --> 36:30.440
We should just go back to Anhui

36:30.440 --> 36:31.640
and grow tea instead.

36:33.480 --> 36:34.680
Not just the two of us,

36:35.920 --> 36:37.980
but also the little one in your belly.

36:39.150 --> 36:40.190
You're all talk.

36:43.510 --> 36:45.570
If there are gunboats on the Yangtze,

36:45.710 --> 36:47.770
shouldn't we find somewhere to hide?

36:48.190 --> 36:49.190
Let them be there.

36:49.920 --> 36:50.920
They won't fight.

36:51.800 --> 36:53.130
It's just that business

36:53.190 --> 36:54.850
will be difficult from now on.

36:55.280 --> 36:56.030
They keep

36:56.030 --> 36:57.760
bringing their gunboats here.

36:57.920 --> 36:59.120
How can we negotiate?

37:00.280 --> 37:01.680
It's truly infuriating.

37:02.030 --> 37:02.710
Mr. Gu.

37:04.190 --> 37:04.710
Yes?

37:04.920 --> 37:05.780
Someone's here

37:05.880 --> 37:07.510
asking you to meet him at the door.

37:07.510 --> 37:08.770
Why doesn't he come in?

37:08.800 --> 37:10.730
He insists you meet him at the door.

37:11.360 --> 37:13.090
Who is it with such an attitude?

37:29.800 --> 37:30.360
Bastard.

37:38.800 --> 37:39.930
How dare you show up!

37:42.630 --> 37:43.320
Heizi.

37:43.590 --> 37:44.560
Who is this?

37:45.760 --> 37:46.820
What are you doing?

37:48.760 --> 37:50.060
Don't hold me back!

37:50.190 --> 37:51.070
Have you gone crazy?

37:51.070 --> 37:52.840
Don't hold me back, I said!

37:53.070 --> 37:54.150
How dare you come here!

37:54.150 --> 37:55.030
Alright, alright.

37:55.030 --> 37:55.690
You rascal!

38:05.710 --> 38:06.070
Here.

38:06.960 --> 38:07.320
Hey!

38:08.360 --> 38:09.780
Put this on your eye.

38:09.840 --> 38:11.300
The bruise will heal soon.

38:26.480 --> 38:27.630
You're just lazy.

38:28.000 --> 38:30.530
If I taught you a few moves,
he'd be dead by now.

38:31.070 --> 38:32.290
Don't you dare help.

38:32.880 --> 38:34.030
If I helped,

38:34.190 --> 38:35.110
your body

38:35.150 --> 38:36.410
would already be cold.

38:36.440 --> 38:37.480
Even better.

38:41.670 --> 38:43.070
You should go back first.

38:45.150 --> 38:46.360
Talk things out properly.

38:46.360 --> 38:47.560
Don't fight anymore.

39:00.510 --> 39:02.240
You have the nerve to come here?

39:06.840 --> 39:07.670
I can't enter

39:08.590 --> 39:09.710
Nanjing now.

39:11.590 --> 39:12.760
I don't know what kind of

39:12.760 --> 39:13.280
vicious tactics

39:13.280 --> 39:15.340
that old bastard will use against me.

39:16.510 --> 39:17.550
Did you just come to see

39:17.550 --> 39:18.680
if I'm still around?

39:20.230 --> 39:21.670
I've packed my bags,

39:23.070 --> 39:24.870
ready to go to Ningguta anytime.

39:26.190 --> 39:27.000
Isn't you going to Ningguta

39:27.000 --> 39:28.000
a good thing?

39:29.110 --> 39:30.230
You should have stayed there

39:30.230 --> 39:31.150
to start with, no?

39:31.150 --> 39:33.080
Is something wrong with your head?

39:35.030 --> 39:36.280
Why did you do that?

39:37.200 --> 39:38.070
I can't help you now

39:38.070 --> 39:39.000
even if I want to, you know?

39:39.000 --> 39:40.400
I don't need your help!

39:40.550 --> 39:42.150
You can't help me either!

39:43.710 --> 39:45.130
I'm just

39:45.230 --> 39:46.510
a useless, incompetent person,

39:46.510 --> 39:48.580
a child you all make fun of,

39:48.710 --> 39:50.170
a worm, a traitor—

39:50.230 --> 39:51.500
but so what?

39:52.070 --> 39:53.000
You should've just

39:53.000 --> 39:54.920
rotted and died in Ningguta!

39:59.880 --> 40:01.880
I've lost my entire family.

40:06.280 --> 40:07.960
I have nowhere to go.

40:14.230 --> 40:16.000
After I'm gone,

40:17.110 --> 40:20.030
I hope you and Li Qin
will be good brothers.

40:21.360 --> 40:22.590
Take good care of him.

40:24.280 --> 40:26.920
This kid is quite clever,

40:28.000 --> 40:30.190
but he is too impulsive.

40:32.590 --> 40:34.400
If he gets into serious trouble,

40:35.150 --> 40:36.110
for the sake of

40:36.110 --> 40:38.570
how I helped you
solve your problems before,

40:38.920 --> 40:40.080
please protect him.

40:40.960 --> 40:42.710
Parents always plan

40:42.750 --> 40:44.410
for their children's future.

40:59.810 --> 41:02.170
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

41:11.730 --> 41:13.950
[Righteous and Diligent]

41:16.800 --> 41:17.460
Greetings,

41:18.760 --> 41:19.640
Sir.

41:20.150 --> 41:21.190
There is no place left

41:21.190 --> 41:21.920
for you

41:21.960 --> 41:23.230
in Liangjiang.

41:25.070 --> 41:25.670
I know.

41:26.630 --> 41:28.710
The Emperor and Empress Dowager
are furious.

41:28.660 --> 41:30.640
[Righteous and Diligent]

41:29.110 --> 41:30.760
They're confiscating your property

41:30.760 --> 41:32.150
and all your shops.

41:33.710 --> 41:34.230
Yes.

41:35.070 --> 41:36.660
You're still young.

41:37.440 --> 41:38.910
Don't do such things

41:39.030 --> 41:40.190
out of spite.

41:40.250 --> 41:43.170
[Righteous and Diligent]

41:40.550 --> 41:42.000
If you handle the salt matter

41:42.000 --> 41:43.070
properly,

41:43.480 --> 41:44.560
I'll protect you.

41:45.280 --> 41:46.250
The Qing Dynasty

41:46.280 --> 41:47.960
cannot afford such a scandal.

41:50.550 --> 41:51.780
What if I can't?

41:55.550 --> 41:57.480
If you die,

41:57.840 --> 41:58.880
disappear,

41:59.280 --> 42:00.400
and turn to ashes,

42:01.230 --> 42:02.720
I'll put those ashes

42:02.880 --> 42:04.260
in a cannon shell

42:04.550 --> 42:06.960
and fire it into the sea.

42:08.710 --> 42:10.800
Let's see who can prove

42:11.320 --> 42:13.440
those deals you've made.

42:19.490 --> 42:22.110
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

42:24.280 --> 42:26.080
If I were afraid of these things,

42:27.510 --> 42:28.970
I wouldn't have come here.

42:29.840 --> 42:30.320
Sir,

42:31.510 --> 42:32.640
before coming here,

42:33.510 --> 42:34.920
I've signed a contract
to transfer my shares

42:34.920 --> 42:37.150
with the British Consulate.

42:40.480 --> 42:41.890
If my personal safety

42:41.920 --> 42:42.940
is threatened,

42:44.880 --> 42:46.230
the warship on the Yangtze River

42:46.230 --> 42:47.360
will not let you off.

42:48.760 --> 42:49.760
Don't believe me?

42:51.230 --> 42:52.030
Just try it.

42:57.400 --> 42:59.890
You're determined to betray your country,

42:59.960 --> 43:00.580
aren't you?
